# Residual joint learning on the single slit (plan 2026-11-06, sections 3/5/7).
#
# GEOMETRY AS SPECIFIED BY THE PLAN (section 3): joint_slit, x=-2.5, 90 steps.
#
# WARNING - the baseline gate FAILS on this geometry, 0/32. The base
# checkpoint was trained on single_wall_slit at x=-1.5 with 60 steps and
# sensor_grad_mode=detached, so it does not fly the joint_slit task at all.
# That result is recorded in the plan as section 3.1 and must be resolved
# before arms A-F are launched; this file is kept at the plan's geometry so the
# blocker stays reproducible rather than being papered over by editing the
# scene until the base happens to pass.
#
# The three deliberate differences from the base are:
#   * the research 50 ms exposure profile (the provisional hardware calibration
#     is untouched);
#   * the fixed operating point in that profile's units - the old E=0.10 is
#     890 us, which is E=0.01583166 here, NOT 0.10 (0.10 would mean 5090 us);
#   * the recorded-motion shutter integral instead of extrapolation.
--scene_layout joint_slit
--policy_arch residual_joint
--residual_base_checkpoint checkpoint/2026-09-24-11-35-14/final.pth
--joint_backward consistent
--grad_decay 1
--observation_grad_mode full
--pose_gradient_estimator warp_ste
--gray_temporal_samples 9
--camera_control_mode learned
--sensor_grad_mode full
--imx900_calibration configs/calibration/grayscale_research_50ms.json
--exposure_trajectory history
--exposure_history_length 4
--gray_saturation_mode ste
--fixed_camera_exposure 0.01583166
--fixed_camera_gain 0.02
--simple_start_x -2.5
--simple_wall_x 0
--simple_goal_x 1.5
--simple_slit_half_y 0.15
--simple_slit_center_y_min -0.75
--simple_slit_center_y_max 0.75
--simple_slit_center_z 1.5
--simple_back_wall_x_min 2.0
--simple_back_wall_x_max 2.85
--gray_transition_x 0
--gray_transition_width 0.25
--gray_dark_scale 0.12
--gray_bright_scale 2.2
--gray_width 96
--gray_height 72
--gray_nn_width 48
--gray_nn_height 36
--cam_angle 5
--base_control_freq 15
--control_dt_jitter 0
--flight_max_speed 1.15
--max_acc_cmd 2.2
--timesteps 90
--batch_size 4
--loss_v_window 12
--scenarios dark bright dark_to_bright bright_to_dark
--no-amp
